OL,3,AUS removes all bombers from RAF
OL,4,AFairford base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has withdrawn all of its bombers
OL,7,Ffrom RAF Fairford, the British military
OL,8,Fbase at the centre of an incident being
OL,9,Finvestigated by counter terror police.
OL,11,FA statement from a US department
OL,12,Fofficial confirmed on Sunday it had
OL,13,Fremoved all of its bombers from the
OL,14,Fbase back to their home stations in
OL,15,FAmerica.
OL,17,FThe US did not give a reason for the
OL,18,Fwithdrawal, but it follows a major
OL,19,Fincident on 27 September when police
OL,20,Fwere alerted to three "suspicious
OL,21,Fvehicles" near the airbase in
OL,22,FGloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
