OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS removes all bombers from RAF
OL,4,AFairford base
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men were initially arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of terror offences near the
OL,8,Fbase and subsequently released on
OL,9,Fpolice bail. A sixth man, a UK-Iranian
OL,10,Fnational, was also later arrested and
OL,11,Freleased on bail.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
