OL,3,APolls close in Brazil as Lula and
OL,4,AFlavio Bolsonaro remain neck and neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls have closed in Brazil's general
OL,7,Felection, after voters queued in long
OL,8,Flines for a tight first round of the
OL,9,Fpresidential race.
OL,11,FAfter casting his ballot, 80-year-old
OL,12,Fleft-wing President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,13,FSilva warned that the choice was
OL,14,Fbetween democracy and "barbarism".
OL,16,FHis challenger, right-winger Flavio
OL,17,FBolsonaro, 45, said he wanted to "free
OL,18,Fthe Brazilian people".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
