OL,3,APolls close in Brazil as Lula and
OL,4,AFlavio Bolsonaro remain neck and neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe result is forecast to be close. BBC
OL,7,FBrazil's poll aggregator shows that the
OL,8,Fgap between Lula and Bolsonaro is only
OL,9,Ftwo points. If no candidate gets more
OL,10,Fthan 50% of the vote, the election will
OL,11,Fgo to a run-off on 25 October.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
