OL,3,AEthiopian rebel forces withdraw from
OL,4,ATigray regional capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebel forces in Ethiopia's northern
OL,7,FTigray region have said they have
OL,8,Ftemporarily withdrawn from the regional
OL,9,Fcapital, Mekelle, as fighting with the
OL,10,Fnational army moves towards the city.
OL,12,FThe Tigray People's Liberation Front
OL,13,F(TPLF), which has been running the
OL,14,Fregion, said its decision to relocate
OL,15,Fwas made because of concerns about
OL,16,Frisks to civilians.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
